  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan received that fire path inheritance and at first did not care about it, feeling she would not use it in her whole life, then under later coincidences chose to focus on fire path. She had no fire path dao marks, but she possessed all the Immortal Gu of Blazing Heaven Demoness after Sixth Hair took them from Dark Flow Giant City and Ying Wu Xie refined them and gave them to her. With Blazing Heaven Demoness’ true inheritance and those Immortal Gu, she could almost replicate all of Blazing Heaven Demoness’ methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1256
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "char_sixth_hair",
        "loc_dark_flow_giant_city",
        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan rates Hei Lou Lan as the most “loyal” of the remaining side, but only rank six in cultivation, with Great Strength True Martial Physique wasted on fire path, bent on avenging her mother. Relying on the exquisite Blazing Heaven true inheritance, her battle strength can barely reach first rate in rank seven, and he calls her definitely the weakest of that group.",
      "chapters": [
        1376
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-strength",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_great_strength_true_martial_physique"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan had obtained Blazing Heaven Demoness’ inheritance and Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan did not take them, since he had enough Immortal Gu, leaving them for her so she could fight effectively and obtain more souls.",
      "chapters": [
        1464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-gu-retained",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the fate war, Hei Lou Lan possessed her aunts’ true inheritances, and after enough pondering she resolutely changed to cultivating Blazing Heaven Demoness’ fire path.",
      "chapters": [
        2017
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
